    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389">

                <pb facs="0550" n="508" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg508"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1863-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 10, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 4th instant, relative to the circumstances under
                    which the United States ship <pb facs="0551" n="509" xml:id="pg509"/> Tuscarora
                    recently exercised the belligerent right of visit, in the case of the British
                    merchant vessel Thistle, and to inform you that a copy of it has been
                    communicated to the Secretary of the Navy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
